<title>AUSTRIA: Radex-Heraklith sees dividend steady at 14 ATS.</title>
<headline>Radex-Heraklith sees dividend steady at 14 ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's Radex-Heraklith Industriebeteiligungen AG, a maker of fire proof and insulation materials, said on Monday it expected to pay an unchanged 1996 dividend of 14 schillings per share.</p>
<p>&quot;It will most probably be the same level as last year. If you ask me, it'll be unchanged,&quot; board member Rudolf Kanzi told Reuters.  </p>
<p>The group last week said it expected 1996 net profit to rise some 10 percent above last year's 467.4 million schillings.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
